    "rawResponseText": "For an **existing upper-upscale hotel asset** in the Caribbean and Latin America, owners should first look at **upper-upscale and adjacent luxury-to-upscale brands** that already have a strong regional footprint or appear on upper-upscale chain-scale lists.[1][3][5]\n\nThe most relevant brands from the provided results are:\n\n- **Marriott**: Marriott Hotels, Sheraton, Westin, Le Méridien, Tribute Portfolio, and Delta are listed in the upper-upscale tier.[1][3]\n- **Hilton**: Hilton, Curio Collection, and Embassy Suites are identified as upper-upscale brands.[1][5]\n- **Hyatt**: Hyatt Regency and Hyatt Centric are placed in the upper-upscale tier, and Hyatt also has a notable Caribbean/Latin America presence through properties like Grand Hyatt and other regional resorts.[1][2][5]\n- **IHG**: Kimpton is listed as upper-upscale, and the brand has a regional presence through properties such as Kimpton Tres Rios Playa del Carmen.[1][5]\n- **Accor / lifestyle-adjacent options**: While not explicitly categorized in the search results, the regional portfolio shown includes **SLS Punta del Este** and **Vignette Collection** properties, suggesting lifestyle/conversion-friendly flags may be relevant in the region.[5]\n- **Autograph Collection / Luxury Collection**: These Marriott soft brands appear in the region and may suit repositioning if the asset can support a higher-end or distinctive conversion strategy.[5]\n\nIf the goal is a **straight upper-upscale conversion**, the strongest fit from the results is usually one of the core full-service brands:\n- **Marriott**\n- **Sheraton**\n- **Westin**\n- **Le Méridien**\n- **Hilton**\n- **Hyatt Regency**\n- **Hyatt Centric**\n- **Kimpton**[1][3][5]\n\nIf the asset has a **distinctive design, strong resort setting, or independent identity**, a **soft brand** may be more attractive:\n- **Tribute Portfolio**\n- **Curio Collection**\n- **Autograph Collection**\n- **Vignette Collection**[1][5]\n\nA practical conversion shortlist for the Caribbean/Latin America would therefore be:\n- **Marriott / Sheraton / Westin / Le Méridien**\n- **Hilton / Curio Collection / Embassy Suites**\n- **Hyatt Regency / Hyatt Centric**\n- **Kimpton**\n- **Tribute Portfolio / Autograph Collection / Vignette Collection**[1][3][5]\n\nIf you want, I can narrow this to the **best brands by asset type**: city hotel, resort, all-inclusive, or soft-brand conversion.",
